w idols, while on stage her presence is very sultry.\n\nPose and background is up to you.\n\nKaren\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Sfuhif95H0U4a9DJG3QR9ttcuQeHgl3u?usp=drive_link\n\nThanks in advance!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@walkingsandwich/works/60", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/47281969/uploads/origins/746695c4-3d30-4f41-a00f-a104a34a1320?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=eec876c6933b79ea0cdaa02d272319e6", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2369804, "client_id": 2810990, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@walkingsandwich/works/59", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2369804, "client_id": 1975927, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7b79f79e/uploads/origins/d593713f-e693-489e-afe1-004ce38197b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a39c9abfbf2c253f2f3464c76032a932", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/7b79f79e/uploads/origins/d593713f-e693-489e-afe1-004ce38197b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b6bd104db5a835bef2f14df7fd77da39", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello there, artist. I'd like to make a request for my signature OC \"Aether Bliss\".\nAether is from a space opera I'm working on. She's a 21 year old starfreighter pilot (basically a space trucker) who gets caught up in a planet hopping adventure to stop a galactic war. \nPersonality wise she's a very cheeky tomboy type character.\n\nPose up to you.\nBackground is also up to you.\n\nLast details, please make sure to make the patch on her jacket green instead of blue and her nails painted red.\n\nAether Bliss\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EFpId5gRhCoQEGfLVL4KfdRTY13f-KN9?usp=drive_link\n\nExpression\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1R7hNwgmtG6uP8z6nR8ZThIyVm8YosZYQ/view?usp=drive_link\n\nJacket patch\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1P_fUjLibKE0XPcyzFWf88bxneswWI929/view?usp=drive_link\n\nThank you in advance!", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@walkingsandwich/works/58", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2369804, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/07a5409a/uploads/origins/1c9a3453-f44d-4b1a-a416-dc0203e10412?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e0bdca855e45d6da509dddcc0184e71", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/07a5409a/uploads/origins/1c9a3453-f44d-4b1a-a416-dc0203e10412?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=968c927d67ea5a56d03f941f8fa485bf", "src_set": ""}, "body": "この魔女を描けますか？\n\nhttps://www.deviantart.com/stash/2160a8kxdjis\n\n彼女は陰謀を企み、人を操る性質を持っています。\nこの魔女は現代を舞台にした物語の登場人物です。威厳のある淑女のように振る舞いますが、しばしばファウスト的なやり方で他人を操ります。\n細長い瞳孔と蛇のような牙を持ち、身長2.4メートルで痩せていますが、それ以外は人間のように見えます。\n彼女は蛇と酸を操る力を持っており、それが彼女の外見の由来です。\n普段は伝統的な青い傘を持ち、怒るとそれを武器として使うことがよくあります。", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@walkingsandwich/works/57", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2369804, "client_id": 2011777, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6c1656d3/uploads/origins/f4d8abb3-e8c0-46cf-bbaa-ea3c263417e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=36b4211e85f927de59cfd7f22324e918", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6c1656d3/uploads/origins/f4d8abb3-e8c0-46cf-bbaa-ea3c263417e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a723327fb78c61029fda65cc2c7aa555", "src_set": ""}, "body": "ふわふわプラスチック人間 様\n\n初めて依頼させて頂きます、甕下 星辰と申します。\n今回は、拙宅の篝 六連(カガリ ムツラ)のイラストをお願いしたく思います。\n\n（簡単な設定）\n・妖怪や神仏などを討伐、もしくは保護する職に就いている。\n・六つの光が宿る、星空の様な瞳をしている。（両目併せて十二個・『六連星の瞳』）\n・鈍い青色をした一升(イッショウ)・灰色の一斗(イット)という二挺拳銃使い。\n・近接戦にはナイフや日本刀も使用。\n\nまた可能でありましたら、Xなど他サイトにてSKEBでの依頼を明記・ふわふわプラスチック人間様のIDを記載の上で紹介させて頂きたく思います。\n\nよろしくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/98791537", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@walkingsandwich/works/56", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8b66edc0/uploads/origins/3e501909-a694-433d-8fc7-cb07c2a6f190?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=fd46f1fa2e8d9c60cfba6e9bf0403a16", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2369804, "client_id": 2810990, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@walkingsandwich/works/55", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2369804, "client_id": 2482437, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4c7a3e74/uploads/origins/a072d6af-a5ed-4b2b-bf8c-